### ==============================================================================
### Opsflow Workflow Engine (Component 1) - REST API & Workflow Execution
###
### Can be executed directly with:
### - VS Code REST Client extension (Ctrl+Alt+R / Cmd+Alt+R)
### - IntelliJ / JetBrains HTTP Client
### - HTTPie / curl
###
### Default Port: 8000
### Simulated EMS Port: 9000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@emsSimUrl = http://localhost:9000
@apiKey = admin_key
@jsonContentType = application/json
@orgId = 28753
@alertChannel = #ops-alerts

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. HEALTH, READINESS & PROMETHEUS METRICS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 0.1 Health Check (Liveness Probe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 0.2 Readiness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### 0.3 Prometheus Metrics Exposition
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. WORKFLOW DISCOVERY & INSPECTION
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 List All Registered Workflows
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.2 Inspect 'spare-parts-inventory-audit' Metadata & Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/spare-parts-inventory-audit
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.3 Inspect 'spare-parts-inventory-sync' Metadata & Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/spare-parts-inventory-sync
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.4 Inspect 'equipment-status-lookup' Metadata & Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/equipment-status-lookup
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.5 Inspect 'purchase-order-tracking' Metadata & Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/purchase-order-tracking
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.6 Inspect 'target-stock-optimization' Metadata & Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/target-stock-optimization
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.7 Inspect 'procurement-rfq-stock-optimization' Metadata & Schema (Dd.yaml spec)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/procurement-rfq-stock-optimization
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. TRIGGER WORKFLOW RUNS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Run 'spare-parts-inventory-audit' (Synchronous wait for 5 seconds)
# Calls EMS simulator to fetch stock list, iterates foreach item to retrieve 3 datasets,
# merges records with join, persists to SQLite and publishes dataset.
# @name triggerAuditSync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/spare-parts-inventory-audit/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "alert_channel": "{{alertChannel}}"
  }
}

### 2.2 Run 'spare-parts-inventory-audit' with Idempotency-Key
# Safe for automated retry triggers - duplicate requests return the same run ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/spare-parts-inventory-audit/runs
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-trigger-uuid-001
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "alert_channel": "{{alertChannel}}"
  }
}

### 2.3 Run 'spare-parts-inventory-sync' (Direct Stock Status Sync)
# @name triggerStockSync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/spare-parts-inventory-sync/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}"
  }
}

### 2.4 Run 'spare-parts-inventory-audit' with On-Demand Dev Mode Logging ("_dev": true)
# Triggers full dev logging (calls, transforms, responses) directly in the API server console
# @name triggerAuditWithDev
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/spare-parts-inventory-audit/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "alert_channel": "{{alertChannel}}",
    "_dev": true
  }
}

### 2.5 Run 'equipment-status-lookup' (Work Order & Maintenance Inspection)
# @name triggerEquipmentLookup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/equipment-status-lookup/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "work_order_number": "WO-2026-001",
    "wip_entity_id": "337389615"
  }
}

### 2.6 Run 'purchase-order-tracking' (Item PO Status & Buyer Details)
# @name triggerPoTracking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/purchase-order-tracking/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "search_keyword": "MOTOR"
  }
}

### 2.7 Run 'target-stock-optimization' (Target Stock, Safety Stock & Onhand Analysis)
# @name triggerTargetStockOpt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/target-stock-optimization/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "item_description": "Motor"
  }
}

### 2.8 Run 'procurement-rfq-stock-optimization' (Based on Dd.yaml & Nexacro traces)
# Evaluates 6 interlocks, remaining stock, RFQ states, and calculates purchase requisitions
# @name triggerProcurementOpt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/procurement-rfq-stock-optimization/runs?wait=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "inputs": {
    "organization_id": "{{orgId}}",
    "item_code": "QDAB03583",
    "alert_channel": "{{alertChannel}}"
  }
}



### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. RUN STATUS & PER-STEP EXECUTION DIAGNOSTICS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Get Run Status (Replace run_id with value from trigger response)
@activeRunId = {{triggerAuditSync.response.body.run_id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{activeRunId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3.2 Get Per-Step Execution Details (Latency, Attempts, Step Statuses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{activeRunId}}/steps
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3.3 Get Detailed Run Execution Log File (Plain text with calls, transforms, responses, timings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{activeRunId}}/logs
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3.4 Cancel In-Progress Run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/{{activeRunId}}/cancel
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. QUERY PUBLISHED READ-MODEL DATASETS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Query 'spare_parts_audit_dataset' (Cursor-paginated items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/spare_parts_audit_dataset?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4.2 Query 'spare_parts_audit_dataset' Schema (Inferred column types)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/spare_parts_audit_dataset/schema
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4.3 Query 'spare_parts_inventory' (Stock Status sync dataset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/spare_parts_inventory?limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4.4 Query 'equipment_status_dataset' (Work Order & Equipment Maintenance dataset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/equipment_status_dataset?limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4.5 Query 'item_po_status_dataset' (PO Status tracking dataset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/item_po_status_dataset?limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4.6 Query 'target_stock_optimization_dataset' (Target Stock Analysis dataset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/target_stock_optimization_dataset?limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4.7 Query 'procurement_stock_optimization_dataset' (Procurement & RFQ Interlocks dataset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/procurement_stock_optimization_dataset?limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. WEBHOOK SUBSCRIPTIONS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 List Active Webhook Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5.2 Register Outbound Webhook Subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "target_url": "https://webhook.site/test-receiver",
  "event_types": ["spare_parts.audit.completed"],
  "secret": "my-webhook-hmac-secret"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. EMS SIMULATION PLATFORM VERIFICATION (CROSS-CHECK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Check EMS Simulator Health
GET {{emsSimUrl}}/health

### 6.2 View Execution Logs on EMS Simulator (Verify calls from opsflow)
GET {{emsSimUrl}}/admin/logs?limit=10
